    "rich_text_fHmAkH": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_UTHCPj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "do not duplicate",
            "seo_h_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_8Um3YJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Whitaker Group and adidas present Do Not Duplicate, a cultural platform grounded in individuality, creative authorship, and the lived experiences that shape how people move through sport and culture.<strong><br/><br/>Individuality Cannot Be Reproduced</strong></p><p>Within Do Not Duplicate, individuality is revealed through instinct and intention.</p><p>Those shaping culture are not repeating patterns. They move with awareness, guided by lived experience and the discipline to recognize a moment before it becomes visible to others. Expression is formed through perspective and conviction rather than imitation.</p><p><strong>A Reflection of Culture</strong></p><p>Culture evolves through individuals who see differently.</p><p>Every environment carries its own rhythm, shaped by tradition, energy, and lived experience. Do Not Duplicate draws from these moments, translating them into expressions that reflect both origin and evolution without replication.</p><p><strong>A Commitment to Individuality</strong></p><p>At its core, Do Not Duplicate is a commitment to personal authorship.</p><p>Each expression interprets cultural reference points through material, form, and construction. Texture, proportion, and detail are used with intention, creating pieces that reflect individuality rather than conformity.</p><p><strong>The Expression Continues</strong></p><p>Do Not Duplicate is an ongoing exploration of instinct and identity.</p><p>Each chapter builds on the last, examining how individuals move through culture with clarity and purpose. What emerges is not repetition, but a series of distinct expressions shaped by perspective, discipline, and time.<br/><br/>The platform reflects the individuals and communities shaping culture through instinct, creativity, and lived experience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Nn6mTt": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>All final sale. No returns or exchanges. Please allow for 5-10 days for domestic and 10-15 days for international. Reminder to also verify your shipping address is correct.<br/></p><p><strong>PLEASE NOTE: </strong>SOME SHIPPING DESTINATION EXCLUSIONS APPLY, SHIPPING CHARGES AND LIMITED AVAILABILITY TO DESTINATIONS OUTSIDE OF THE U.S. ARE BASED ON YOUR COUNTRY’S POLICIES AND MAY DIFFER. ALL WINNING ENTRIES WILL BE SELECTED BEFORE LAUNCH AND SHIPPED AFTER LAUNCH.</p>"
          }
        },
